    "$t": "鼓井ê記憶"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張寶明</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjj3sx0gE3Z2nl0Tio9prHBUY5iu7TVTRFjE8H7AMCdf8c--5YFHZgRUI7MT-z8onWQ4pR_09ctg1Qh8-owAfmxK10VEBXdFLuDlioODZFHYLVHOrysDYidC1IgCWi4zGykcCInPFZ0ktGqaFfg8K6LfF0g6LDKhnaXuRwY1JF0bTavhDlyD15439sMVg/s2688/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%B5%E5%AF%B6%E6%98%8E%20%E9%BC%93%E4%BA%951.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1520\" data-original-width=\"2688\" height=\"362\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjj3sx0gE3Z2nl0Tio9prHBUY5iu7TVTRFjE8H7AMCdf8c--5YFHZgRUI7MT-z8onWQ4pR_09ctg1Qh8-owAfmxK10VEBXdFLuDlioODZFHYLVHOrysDYidC1IgCWi4zGykcCInPFZ0ktGqaFfg8K6LfF0g6LDKhnaXuRwY1JF0bTavhDlyD15439sMVg/w640-h362/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%B5%E5%AF%B6%E6%98%8E%20%E9%BC%93%E4%BA%951.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">新正專工來美濃（Bi-long）食粿仔，beh來享受正港ê古早味。無意中發見一塊路牌寫「永安老街」，無，就來kā行一tsuā，當做行春，欣賞古早文化mā bē-bái。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">街頭lau過巷尾，古厝、古物、倒牆、新厝、現代品、轎車……，tshap雜tī尪仔頭--裡，新--ê kā舊--ê tshiàng-tù，生活kap文化起衝突，感覺bē和諧，無hit-lō ē huah「Uah！」ê tshóng碰，有一屑屑仔可惜。不而過，嫌bóng嫌，mā是有值得欣賞ê所在，beh khioh啥來欣賞？介在你ê心思iah是興頭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">沿路有看著幾口仔鼓井真趣味，hōo我真注目。Tsit幾口仔鼓井若照紹介牌仔來看，lóng有倚百冬ê歷史，mā已經lóng功成身退--ah。其中有一口井tsiânn特殊，我m̄ bat看過tsit款樣--ê，tī井墘ê外壁堵貼春聯，邊--a koh起一座后土。聽講tse表示主人家對tsit口井ê敬重kap感恩，服sāi ê后土就是beh保護井水ê平安，庇佑井水永遠bùn bē完。Tsit世人頭kái看--見，我khah ē無tsùn-būn--著--leh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjoFhwqkdbQCnOesBY7bW7d6bmu6Zqy_ExxC1eG8b4VIpk6FbRxEPKBR6jKjZ2BNeyunQehssFi96tl-f0BZPU4WsJZn3qnJ_CVIR5hH-ZGC9TnqBKf0mTN037MDM6Bea5kweLSNZrhvaR8YCq32WHzqj10lVyzrkDu2KWDsCjWdLWFDkeaJIKdR4ebDQ/s2688/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%B5%E5%AF%B6%E6%98%8E%20%E9%BC%93%E4%BA%952.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2688\" data-original-width=\"1520\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjoFhwqkdbQCnOesBY7bW7d6bmu6Zqy_ExxC1eG8b4VIpk6FbRxEPKBR6jKjZ2BNeyunQehssFi96tl-f0BZPU4WsJZn3qnJ_CVIR5hH-ZGC9TnqBKf0mTN037MDM6Bea5kweLSNZrhvaR8YCq32WHzqj10lVyzrkDu2KWDsCjWdLWFDkeaJIKdR4ebDQ/w362-h640/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%B5%E5%AF%B6%E6%98%8E%20%E9%BC%93%E4%BA%952.jpg\" width=\"362\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就án-ne，隨停落來查后土ê資料，原來后土是道教ê「承天傚法厚德光大后土皇地祇」神，俗稱「后土娘娘」，管顧土地頂kuân ê一切。Kap管理天頂ê昊天上帝（玉皇大帝）tsiânn做lán所知ê「皇天后土」神。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就是講--m̄，tsit口井有神明駐駕leh保護，莫怪，我好玄探頭看井--裡有啥mi̍h ê時，心肝頭是hiah-nī仔定著。一般，我探頭看井ê時，心肝頭m̄是tám-tám niâ，he是非常ê驚惶。因為探頭看井，he驚惶ê烏影iáu厚厚厚罩tī我ê心肝底。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHTtkNWYMKTZ64EROJHg2iYUxlIfNf4zYMUqgaBn8HP_oSI-UT9CWyHnHFUKJZYuO049wEqa-oxNLrB-dXhs749M0zZIdz_mSXmk9NI8LO-UQcZMZoREjZnGmbuhd7EU1PA94gfmneYNKfwJATvZY4HKZGckPSdlDTLss0FZuxVhtHXL8yRplj9_gHYQ/s2688/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%B5%E5%AF%B6%E6%98%8E%20%E9%BC%93%E4%BA%953.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2688\" data-original-width=\"1520\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHTtkNWYMKTZ64EROJHg2iYUxlIfNf4zYMUqgaBn8HP_oSI-UT9CWyHnHFUKJZYuO049wEqa-oxNLrB-dXhs749M0zZIdz_mSXmk9NI8LO-UQcZMZoREjZnGmbuhd7EU1PA94gfmneYNKfwJATvZY4HKZGckPSdlDTLss0FZuxVhtHXL8yRplj9_gHYQ/w362-h640/%EF%BC%88%E7%9B%B8%E7%89%87%EF%BC%89%E5%BC%B5%E5%AF%B6%E6%98%8E%20%E9%BC%93%E4%BA%953.jpg\" width=\"362\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē記得iáu未讀小學ê時，阮厝後ê弓蕉宅仔是我kap囡仔伴tshit-thô ê基地。倚中ng有一口鼓井。有一工拄bâ霧仔光，我to iáu leh睏就hōo口面ê huah聲吵--起-來，眾人沿路走、沿路huah：「有查某囡仔跳井！」Hit時好玄koh m̄知好bái就tuè人走去看。一下入去到宅仔，就看著眾人kā鼓井圍kah ba̍t-tsiuh-tsiuh，我nǹg過大人ê跤腿縫，隨影著井邊有白布khàm一个長長ê mi̍h仔，kài成一个人ê形倒tī hia！俺娘uê！頭kái看著死人ê形，是驚kah kā邊--a ê大人大腿mooh-ân-ân，tsit个形影tuè我一世人到tann。後--來，若無囡仔伴的確m̄敢去弓蕉宅仔sńg，從來mā無hit-lō膽koh去看hit口鼓井ê內底--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來到街仔尾，beh倚路口ê邊--a一口井tī--leh，有一个阿伯仔the坐踮井墘，短頭毛kap長喙鬚tsiâu白了了，ná姜子牙、呂洞賓hit款有威儀ê神仙--leh。Tse又koh是啥mih情形？我ná行ná疑心，sa無寮仔門，行來到伊ê身邊想beh掠斟酌，伊suah雄雄用tsíng頭仔áu-khiau kā阮算，「<i>one、two、three、four</i>」làu英語ê模樣，害阮驚一下tsua̋nn大聲笑--出-來，伊mā tuè阮笑kah喙仔li̍h-sai-sai。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgUhasl-BMw_1RwCq8X9NIjIUBFQEiT7ue6YG3ZBW3tu5tCsU6h8eHegMSErtfccmIyaFL1kTtG8HklcvVmIOCMD-aCPQHftPrnLz3UIMkkYitJHCtaXVzSaiB3p8JnFLsYUG5X48eSfQ9niuJWMQiAn1SBXPsjA020afp3ujDNYju0K-PBQNE095QZQ/s1424/347%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjgUhasl-BMw_1RwCq8X9NIjIUBFQEiT7ue6YG3ZBW3tu5tCsU6h8eHegMSErtfccmIyaFL1kTtG8HklcvVmIOCMD-aCPQHftPrnLz3UIMkkYitJHCtaXVzSaiB3p8JnFLsYUG5X48eSfQ9niuJWMQiAn1SBXPsjA020afp3ujDNYju0K-PBQNE095QZQ/w450-h640/347%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiIDqOsyPSGM8JAPN0-VJZeFog5re-sZrXwbT259VxLTBaRBMaqhI44blHQG8rwTF1u2O8HzFF2Imhk5tfTb2UxSA6ZxyRzUo5oAv8E-T8OewUjwcOeLWQlYBHCIR10MJLA6B6mAT0MML0sAEJZ3R2WAizLgkNbSSUwwwbs4Bln6AEuD1w-Xc1mK1G4HQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_010.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiIDqOsyPSGM8JAPN0-VJZeFog5re-sZrXwbT259VxLTBaRBMaqhI44blHQG8rwTF1u2O8HzFF2Imhk5tfTb2UxSA6ZxyRzUo5oAv8E-T8OewUjwcOeLWQlYBHCIR10MJLA6B6mAT0MML0sAEJZ3R2WAizLgkNbSSUwwwbs4Bln6AEuD1w-Xc1mK1G4HQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_010.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjn9PLjJ_wO_OlIcEzsWZYsQsIhUJKBQm6Lsihl44wqjRzMS33WxZaBFf51JhBzaweci5sqRMa0coIzkqUvr0Uc9BMiyHj_JWy042k_KK5uBSyq-eiI3PovBzgxgKyGZfhdMY3cX8zHq9VCL9Xb6Sl1AM4-IhDH1nto356RvxAV26BW2jXQaexkHYY_YA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_011.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjn9PLjJ_wO_OlIcEzsWZYsQsIhUJKBQm6Lsihl44wqjRzMS33WxZaBFf51JhBzaweci5sqRMa0coIzkqUvr0Uc9BMiyHj_JWy042k_KK5uBSyq-eiI3PovBzgxgKyGZfhdMY3cX8zHq9VCL9Xb6Sl1AM4-IhDH1nto356RvxAV26BW2jXQaexkHYY_YA/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1347%E6%9C%9F_011.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>光景bóng uē&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap<b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>台羅</span></b>。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> 347期，2023年2月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
